<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel Finance '96 net profit up 15.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Keppel Finance '96 net profit up 15.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     26.58  vs  23.14</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			3.50  vs   3.50</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    12.95  vs  12.52</p>
<p>    Operating income		     81.64  vs  82.59</p>
<p>    Dividend, other income		1.34  vs   1.12</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    1.62  vs   1.27</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization	   0.58  vs   0.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 36.17  vs  32.87</p>
<p>    Tax					 9.59  vs   9.72</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 36.17  vs  32.87</p>
<p>    Tax					 9.59  vs   9.72</p>
<p>Note - Keppel Finance is a unit of diversified marine conglomerate Keppel Corp.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 870 3080)</p>
